    reg {
        name = "Coefficient table, horizontal luma";
        desc = "Physical address of the horizontal luma scaler coefficient table, as returned by SYS_DRV_GetScaleCoef of hi3536dv100_sys.ko (PROVEN: the sys module run under qemu-arm returns base + table offset of its 0x7D10 byte coefficient buffer; GenSclCfg copies the four results to 0x200..0x20C). Table format (PROVEN from the sys module output): 17 phases (positions 0..16 of 32, the hardware mirrors the other half: INFERRED), horizontal luma 6 taps = 3 words per phase, the other three tables 4 taps = 2 words per phase; taps are 10-bit two's complement in 16-bit lanes (lane 0 = bits 15:0 of word 0), unity gain 512 (every phase sums to 512), center sample at lane 2 (6-tap) / lane 1 (4-tap). Provenance: DYNAMIC: the vendor node builder (VGS_DrvCommSubmitJobToVgs -> VGS_DrvCommPrepareNodes -> VGS_DRV_SetVgsReg, GenSclCfg, VGSSplitAndCrop) was run under qemu-arm with a fake register file and swept one input at a time (2026-11-23, scripts/tools/vgs-static/). Static source: hi3536dv100_vgs.ko (SDK 2.0.2.0 / Hi3536D_MPP_V1.0.1.0 B040, Dec 7 2017).";
